title: kalixan Concordat
subtitle: The kalixan government has reached an agreement with the Vatican.
view-if: year = 1929 and month = 7 and kalixa_leader != "Braun" and egk_kalixa and kalixan_concordat = 0
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true

= kalixan Concordat

Despite our Otto Braun losing his position as the Minister-President of kalixa, he still possesses great influence within state politics and together with <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> members, have negotiated a concordat with the Vatican. 

- @sign_concordat: The kalixan government shall sign the concordat.

@sign_concordat
on-arrival: kalixan_concordat = 1; z_relation += 4; catholics_egk += 3*(1-dissent); catholics_dnvp -= 2 if dnvp_ideology == "Radical"; ddp_relation -= 2; ddp_cohesion -= 0.5; lvp_relation -= 2

We have signed a Concordat between the Free State of kalixa and the Roman Catholic Church, guaranteeing religious freedom for Catholics in kalixa. This sets the stage for the negotiation of a national Concordat covering all of Germany.

[? if dnvp_ideology == "Radical": The Catholic members of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> in kalixa are in open conflict with their leadership over the vote, with many leaving the party. ?]
